# Agent worktrees. A git worktree checked out inside the repo is a second copy
# of the whole source tree: never track it, and never let eslint walk it. Left
# unignored, its src/db/database.types.ts escapes the root-relative ignore in
# eslint.config.js and `npm run lint` reports hundreds of errors from a
# directory nobody is working in.
.claude/worktrees/
